---
description: Mandatory engineering quality, tests, SOLID and security
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow `ENGINEERING_QUALITY.md` and `AGENTS.md` for every code change.
Create or update unit tests for changed behavior, add regression tests for bugs,
review SOLID/maintainability/scalability/security, and run every applicable
quality gate. Gates are fail-closed and must never be bypassed or weakened.
